{"c":[{"name":"20261002T133226Z-6bdfe982409203f3","text":"Writing AXMain on a background fixture window makes it the app's key window with no activation and no z-order change; use it to stage 'user looked at Reference, then went to the form'.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T133226Z-82c44796f08e654e","text":"caret-fixture ignores a pid-posted Cmd-V (no Edit menu); the host falls back to an AXSelectedText write and learns it per app (exe:caret-fixture).","type":"note"}]}
